        "title": "improve: native iOS look with stock SwiftUI navigation, forms, chat, and talk visualizer",
        "body": "Closes #99195\n\n> 🤖 AI-assisted: built with Claude Code; every screen was iterated on the iOS Simulator and human-reviewed at each step.\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where iPhone users navigating the iOS app would see non-native, custom-built UI chrome (floating shadowed cards, hand-rolled headers with hidden navigation bars, custom capsule switches, `.roundedBorder` inputs, status pills, gradient avatars) on every tab, making the app feel un-Apple-like and inconsistent with iOS platform conventions.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nReplaces the custom \"Pro\" component chrome with stock SwiftUI throughout the phone app: real navigation bars (large titles, native back/push, `.searchable`, toolbar menus), `List`/`Form` inset-grouped sections with `LabeledContent`/`Toggle`/`Picker` rows, iMessage-style chat (visible receiver bubbles + iOS 26 glass composer with mic→send swapping, availability-gated), native `ContentUnavailableView` empty/error states, and a new Siri-style Talk waveform (Canvas + TimelineView, MIT-attributed math) that renders the runtime's real states: off = static grey, connecting/thinking = slow breathing, listening = mic-level reactive, speech = full, agent speaking = pulsing. Copy is trimmed to single-line rows per Apple convention. Rebuilt on top of the recent design refresh on `main`; the already-nativized Agents surfaces from `main` are kept as-is. Non-goals: iPad sidebar layouts and Settings sub-flows beyond the converted forms.\n\n## User Impact\n\nThe app now looks and behaves like a native iOS app: standard navigation transitions and back buttons everywhere, familiar Settings-style forms, an iMessage-like chat, pull-to-refresh + native search on Agents, and a Talk screen that visibly reacts to your voice and clearly shows when the mic is off. Net −84 LOC in this diff (removes more custom UI than it adds).\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Built and ran every screen on iPhone 17 simulator (iOS 26.2), Debug, via XcodeBuildMCP; all five tabs launch clean on this branch after rebasing onto current `main` (chat/talk/control/agent/settings smoke: ALIVE).\n- Verified per-screen with simulator screenshots at each iteration, including width-alignment audit across tabs and a pixel comparison of the Settings large-title metrics against Apple's stock Settings app on the same simulator (identical).\n- Talk waveform states verified live (static grey when off; reacts to power/state changes).\n- Before/after screenshots for all core screens in the table below.\n\n### Before / after (iPhone 17 sim, iOS 26.2)\n\n| Screen | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Welcome** | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/01-before-welcome.png\" width=\"260\"> | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/02-after-welcome.png\" width=\"260\"> |\n| **Chat** | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/03-before-chat.png\" width=\"260\"> | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/04-after-chat.png\" width=\"260\"> |\n| **Talk** | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/05-before-talk.png\" width=\"260\"> | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/talk-wave-demo.gif\" width=\"260\"> |\n| **Control** | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/07-before-control.png\" width=\"260\"> | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/08-after-control.png\" width=\"260\"> |\n| **Agents** | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/09-before-agent.png\" width=\"260\"> | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/10-after-agent.png\" width=\"260\"> |\n| **Settings** | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/11-before-settings.png\" width=\"260\"> | <img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/marvkr/e4f63a43f599c3fa48b68267e1b48f0b/raw/12-after-settings.png\" width=\"260\"> |\n\n\n\n\n",
